    "body": "Source of the bug: `zsh` is a massive troll and displays different things as the output of `jobs` depending on whether the output is a tty or not.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4605384/63295496-a5d0b900-c281-11e9-9320-ba0e1e7f1cc5.png)\r\n\r\nAs you can see in the screenshot, after `cd`, in a terminal, `zsh` displays the same output, while in a pipe, it adds an extra line having to do with `pwd`. I'm not sure what the rules are for how this extra line is added.",
